{
  "sequence_id": "seq_84541a1f4b159018",
  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "should be about time..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Badly"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Dammit! Again?! I can't keep control."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "This Itadori Kid!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Fwoo..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "What is he?!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Oh..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T8",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Was every- thing okay?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T9",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "What a surprise!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T10",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Thud"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T11",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "think that"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T12",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Hunk"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T13",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "You really can control it."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T14",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Yeah, but he's kind of annoying."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T15",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "knock"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T16",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "\"No. "
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T17",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "I CAN HEAR HIS voice."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T18",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "It's a miracle that's the only side effect."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T19",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "TP"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Shook"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "What did you do?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "He's heavy."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I knocked him out. Success!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "If he wakes up and isn't possessed ..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T6",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "...he might have potential as a vessel."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T7",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Okay, question for ya..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T8",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "What do I do with him?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T9",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Even if he is a potential vessel...."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T10",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "...he must be executed under Jujutsu regulations."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T11",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "But I don't want to let him die!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Is that a personal opinion?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Yes, a personal opinion."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Please do something about it."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Heh heh. Heh."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T5",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "A precious student's request."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T6",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "leave it to me!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T7",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Yay!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T8",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "So with that, let me reiterate ..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T9",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "FWIP"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T10",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "You're gonna be executed."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T11",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "This story doesn't make sense so far."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T12",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Hey, man, I tried."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T13",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "An execution is an execution, but..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T14",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "... we're suspend- ing the sentence."
    }
  ],
